  "description": "Ubar Hotels and Resorts SAOG is an Omani hospitality group (subsidiary of Mohammed Al Barwani Investment LLC) that owns and operates two Golden Tulip-branded hotels across the Sultanate. The parent company operates Golden Tulip Hotel Nizwa under a Golden Tulip Franchise Limited agreement dating back to 2005, while its 100%-owned subsidiary Al Ahlam Hotel Management LLC operates Golden Tulip Hotel Muscat under a 10-year Golden Tulip MENA brand license agreement running from 2024 through 2033. Alongside room accommodation and food and beverage services at both properties, the group generates ancillary operating lease income from rented commercial space within its buildings.",
